WEBVTT

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Not sideways!</i>

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:05.730
<i>Forward!</i>

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:09.480
Another strike!

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.580
<i>I can see it right in front of me...</i>

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.070
<i>An adversary who's so close
to being a yokozuna!</i>

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.450
<i>A victory that I'm willing
to risk my life for!</i>

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.980
<i>Heads together. Both hands on your belt.</i>

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.170
<i>This is the move I've developed to win!</i>

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.790
<i>I won't give you a chance
to start your motion.</i>

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.180
<i>I can still fight back from this position.</i>

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:40.530
<i>My father taught me
this right overhand grip.</i>

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.310
<i>The move that defines my destiny.</i>

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.180
<i>Even one...</i>

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:45.980
<i>...moment's hesitation...</i>

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.320
<i>...and I'll lose!</i>

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:23.990
<b>Bout 24
"The Dream Continues"</b>

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:35.380
They're evenly matched.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:37.880
Neither can move.

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:42.990
<i>My father once told me</i>

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:44.890
<i>that yokozunas are solitary.</i>

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:49.060
<i>There is no one ahead of them, 
and no signs to guide them.</i>

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.150
<i>Each can only rely on himself.</i>

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:55.360
<i>And he's forced out!</i>

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.650
<i>The yokozuna has been defeated!</i>

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:01.190
<i>Kaoruyama scores a major upset 
by forcing out his opponent!</i>

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:03.470
Your father lost.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:09.030
<i>Whether he won or lost, 
my father never showed emotion,</i>

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.900
<i>but I was unnerved by the 
bloodlust I sensed from him.</i>

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:18.670
<i>I strove to be a good child so I wouldn't 
interfere with his competitions.</i>

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:21.050
<b>Yamatokuni</b>

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:25.050
<i>My father never encouraged or 
discouraged me from doing sumo.</i>

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:31.310
<i>Perhaps I followed in his footsteps 
to show the respect I had for him.</i>

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:34.310
<i>I prepared myself for it.</i>

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:38.690
<i>I had seen him fight on, even when 
he was battered and beaten.</i>

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:43.800
<i>I knew other people treated me differently 
as the son of a great yokozuna.</i>

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.850
<i>I knew I had to uphold 
the honor of his name.</i>

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:50.200
<i>It was my duty to become a 
great yokozuna like my father.</i>

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:52.590
<i>I had to become strong.</i>

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:56.740
<i>Single-mindedly chasing that far-off goal,</i>

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:59.710
<i>I never thought of sumo as fun.</i>

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:04.900
Are you okay?

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:11.450
That boy's incredible.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:13.480
More stoic than any of the others.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.840
It must be that yokozuna blood in him.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.520
He's not the same as us.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.040
I'm jealous.

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:23.320
<i>Yes, this is the solitude 
my father spoke of.</i>

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:26.450
<i>Then I must be following the right path.</i>

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.720
<i>Even if no one else understands,</i>

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:30.950
<i>even if I must go it alone,</i>

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:35.080
<i>I'll find the state of 
yokozuna my father attained.</i>

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.960
Those who run ahead of others

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.630
are solitary.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:43.740
But look beside you.

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:45.720
You have others with you.

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:49.070
Rivals sharing the same determination

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:52.730
to reach that solitary state.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.940
<i>Ushio-kun, I'm grateful to you.</i>

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:05.070
<i>I decided to fight you 
of my own will that day.</i>

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:09.420
<i>Your soul was burning, 
screaming to make itself known.</i>

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:11.120
<i>We fought at full strength.</i>

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:13.870
<i>At that moment...</i>

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:15.910
<i>and even now...</i>

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:19.560
He's...

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.050
smiling?

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.150
Are you okay, ma'am?

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:25.760
Yes, I'm fine.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.860
I mustn't look away.

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:29.940
I'm fine!

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:32.820
I've been the wife of a great 
yokozuna for many years.

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:36.890
As his mother, I have to see 
how much my son has grown.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:39.590
Fight, Hinomaru!

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:42.190
Your mother's watching!

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:52.330
If they just maintain their grips,

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.980
the difference in size will 
wear Onimaru down faster.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:58.500
He's tired from his semifinal bout, 
and his left arm is injured, too.

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:02.010
A long bout hurts his chances,
but he doesn't have an opening.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.190
<i>This is tough...</i>

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:04.920
<i>His strength is incredible.</i>

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.180
<i>It hurts, and it's hard to breathe.</i>

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:08.810
<i>I need to do something.</i>

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.140
<i>Why are you doing sumo?</i>

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.400
He lost again.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.330
He did so well in elementary school.

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.380
It's because he's so small.

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:30.620
He's a good boy, so I'm sure 
he doesn't want to think it...

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:35.500
I'm sorry your late father and I are so small.

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:41.450
I'm sorry I couldn't give you a bigger body.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:49.050
<i>Winning at sumo felt good.</i>

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:52.640
<i>My mom enjoyed seeing me win, too. 
She praised me when I did.</i>

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.690
<i>It made me happy.</i>

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:59.170
<i>She acted so brave in front of me,
so I wanted to please her even more.</i>

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:03.710
<i>It's all for my mother...</i>

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:07.820
<i>Even though she's gone.</i>

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:11.530
<i>No, try to remember.</i>

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:17.080
<i>Why are you doing sumo, Hinomaru?</i>

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:22.960
<i>From the east side, Yokozuna Yamatokuni 
is entering the sumo ring.</i>

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.460
Yokozuna!

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:28.560
Did you want to be like Yamatokuni, too?

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:30.340
Everyone here did.

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:33.460
We started sumo so we could be like him.

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:36.890
No, it's not quite like that.

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:45.730
Hinomaru, here it comes!

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:53.360
<i>Great Serpent Cleaver!</i>

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.580
<i>It's not just for one reason that I'm here.</i>

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:12.340
No, it's not quite like that.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:17.190
I'm thinking of how much fun it'd be 
to throw a huge yokozuna like that.

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:20.560
<i>My initial motivation...</i>

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:22.560
<i>My feeling of loss...</i>

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:24.560
<i>The expectations and my obligations...</i>

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:26.690
<i>The time I've spent with my team...</i>

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.190
<i>and for the sake of my mother, too!</i>

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:32.440
He's burning up.

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:36.870
<i>I love sumo! That's why I'm here!</i>

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:39.620
Hinomaru is smiling in a bout.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:55.800
There!

00:08:58.510 --> 00:08:59.420
<i>Close the gap,</i>

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:02.570
<i>then when his upper body is extended, 
come up from beneath!</i>

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:10.180
Push!

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:14.950
Yes, yes!

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:19.260
<i>It's something that can only 
happen with no weight classes.</i>

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:24.050
<i>The smaller contender rises up 
and thrills the spectators!</i>

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.080
<i>He pulled back? 
He's at the edge of the ring!</i>

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:32.970
<i>A spirit that cannot be contained 
in his small body...</i>

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:35.840
<i>A national treasure, the future of sumo.</i>

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.590
<i>But Sosuke is no different.</i>

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.620
<i>Seeing size and speed</i>

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:46.080
<i>and overwhelming physical energy</i>

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.940
<i>is part of the appeal of sumo.</i>

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:50.150
Kuze's using a left underarm grip.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.960
<i>This isn't all.</i>

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:55.380
<i>The sumo my father and I 
share is more than this.</i>

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:57.630
<i>I'm right here!</i>

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:05.750
<i>True Great Serpent Cleaver!</i>

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:02.620
<b>Right
Overarm
Throw</b>

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:05.750
<b>Right
Overarm
Throw</b>

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:03.450
<b>True
Great
Serpent
Cleaver</b>

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.750
<b>True
Great
Serpent
Cleaver</b>

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:12.380
<i>Reverse Hundred Demon Takedown!</i>

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:10.130
<b>Reverse
Hundred
Demon
Takedown</b>

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:12.380
<b>Reverse
Hundred
Demon
Takedown</b>

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:14.250
They're doing throws on each other.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.880
His reaction was too quick.

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:18.010
<i>He was expecting that.</i>

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.840
<i>I figured you'd counter.</i>

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.100
<i>I believed in your strength!</i>

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.840
Hori-chan, thank you.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:55.370
I probably wouldn't be here 
if it weren't for you.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.430
I didn't know anything about sumo.

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:03.980
I didn't know anything and made fun of it.

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:07.360
But...

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:09.440
When I'm this close...

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:12.940
Every time those carefully 
sculpted bodies crash,

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.150
they make an incredible sound.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:18.150
In a single moment, 
they use countless maneuvers.

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:21.760
I thought it was embarrassing 
that they wore only belts,

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:25.660
but I'm starting to see 
how aesthetic it is.

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:29.550
And the more I learn about 
sumo, the more I understand

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:30.910
how strong he is!

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:35.630
Now matter how many times he's knocked 
back, he still rises up again.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:40.550
It captivates the crowd's eyes and hearts!

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:42.160
This is love.

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:49.600
Love for Hinomaru's sumo.

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:54.190
<i>Am I... going to lose?</i>

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:04.730
<i>I don't want to lose!</i>

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:06.310
<i>I need to stop him.</i>

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:10.450
Shake him!

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:14.750
<i>I'm fighting a serious...</i>

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.800
<i>sumo bout!</i>

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:21.320
<i>I feel how close death is.</i>

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:23.090
<i>It's incredible.</i>

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:27.550
<i>My limits are finally being tested.</i>

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.870
<i>For me to beat him now...</i>

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:34.240
<i>I can't simply imitate my father.</i>

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.310
<i>I must surpass Yamatokuni!</i>

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:41.220
<i>I must surpass a god!</i>

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.120
He's pulling him down!

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.490
Stay strong!

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.620
There is no thought to his movements.

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:54.700
This is something that cannot 
be taught in a training hall.

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:57.130
Yes, instinct!

00:12:57.850 --> 00:12:58.960
<i>I see.</i>

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:02.140
<i>This is what it means to 
drive each other higher.</i>

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:06.890
<b>God
Body
Hammer</b>

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:06.890
<b>God
Body
Hammer</b>

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.890
<i>Pulling Body Slam! God Body Hammer!</i>

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:13.880
<i>An illusion?</i>

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.270
Which is crazier?

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:24.450
<i>I'm small, so I've had to worry 
and work harder than anyone.</i>

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.240
<i>But I've also thought more about sumo, too.</i>

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:32.750
<i>This body has let me enjoy 
sumo more than anyone.</i>

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:34.960
<i>Thank you, Mom.</i>

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.210
<i>His arm...</i>

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:43.090
<i>Is he out of strength?</i>

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:44.840
<i>Is this it?</i>

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:47.090
<i>How cruel can this get?</i>

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:50.480
<i>I'll hate you, god of sumo!</i>

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:00.780
<i>This body has overcome 
every obstacle in its way!</i>

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:02.610
<i>I'm proud of it!</i>

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:05.110
<i>And I'll throw down</i>

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:09.870
<i>any god of sumo that says otherwise!</i>

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:12.280
<b>Right
Underarm
Throw</b>

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:15.120
<i>Right underarm throw! Demon Wheel!</i>

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:15.120
<b>Right
Underarm
Throw</b>

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.120
<b>Demon
Wheel</b>

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.120
<b>Demon
Wheel</b>

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:22.000
Go, Ushio!

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:39.310
I am Ushio Hinomaru.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.260
In order to reach yokozuna,

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:45.500
I must become the strongest 
high school sumo wrestler!

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:05.360
East side wins!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.200
Listen to that cheering.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:18.180
Yeah, and even I can see...

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:21.210
the cascading cushions.

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:43.210
I'm glad that he was

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:45.500
the one who defeated my son.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.590
He had to experience defeat someday.

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:50.950
Now I can see

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:55.440
what he'll do next at the same time.

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:02.090
Let's go.

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:10.070
You did it, Hinomaru.

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:14.450
I'm sure your mother hears the applause, too.

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:18.930
<i>I couldn't have made it here alone.</i>

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:24.460
<i>I've been blessed with strong 
opponents who tested me.</i>

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:27.710
<i>And...</i>

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:31.720
<i>My teammates supported me.</i>

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:34.610
When your dream comes true...

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:39.170
I may not be with you, but I'll be watching.

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:42.430
I'll be watching from the clouds.

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.990
<i>My dream hasn't come true yet.</i>

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:47.860
<i>But...</i>

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:52.900
<i>Sumo...</i>

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:55.200
<i>Battles waged since ancient times in Japan.</i>

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.050
Bow.

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:59.120
<i>It is one of the few combat sports
without weight classes.</i>

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:03.960
<i>Thus, larger and heavier student sumo 
wrestlers have a distinct advantage.</i>

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:09.780
<i>Among those giants, there was one 
who desired to become a yokozuna.</i>

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:14.300
<i>His body was small, sturdy, and...</i>

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.260
East side wins!

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:18.960
<i>...dignified.</i>

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:24.880
<i>The match is over. 
Odachi High School wins 3-2.</i>

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:31.030
Congratulations, guys!

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:33.860
I'm crying because you cried!

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:35.330
Thanks for cheering for me.

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:38.150
Yuma, you're the best in Japan, too!

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:38.870
Yeah.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.590
This was a one-man sumo club...

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.260
But now, it's the strongest team of all!

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:49.160
Sumo...

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:50.840
Thank...

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:56.550
Guys, thank you so much!

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:03.720
<i>I see... They won't compete 
as a team anymore.</i>

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:08.850
Now we wait to see if Hinomaru qualified 
for the All-Japan National Championships.

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:09.790
Yeah.

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.600
Not to worry.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:12.690
Master.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:17.850
He did his part. There's no way they won't 
take him after all that cheering. Right?

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:21.040
Master Yamatokuni!

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:24.200
It's been three years, I believe.

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:27.160
You remembered me.

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:31.790
"Practice for three years from now."

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.860
Those words supported me and 
allowed me to endure until today.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:36.640
Thank you.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.470
That match...

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:43.520
Your team showed us the future of sumo.

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:45.960
The pro league will be waiting for you.

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:50.730
For the future of sumo, 
using that same diligence,

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:55.390
practice for three years from 
now, Ushio Hinomaru-kun.

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:02.710
Don't go saying you'll stay at Eiga High
 because we lost the team tournament, Sosuke.

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:05.140
We'll still win next year.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:07.420
You keep moving forward.

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:12.630
This disappointment...

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:18.820
It may be something I can only 
experience in grade-level sumo.

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:21.760
It's odd to say after I've lost, but...

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:25.010
I'm glad I came to Eiga High.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:27.110
I see!

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:33.270
<i>The National High School Sumo 
Team Tournament champions...</i>

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:36.420
<i>Odachi High School from Chiba!</i>

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:44.280
Thank you for your support!

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:12.940
<i>Ushio-kun competed in the All-Japan 
National Championships.</i>

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:17.440
<i>He lost to Tennoji-san in the 
semifinal and took third place.</i>

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:20.220
<i>Tennoji-san was the champion.</i>

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:24.360
<i>He earned the right to become 
a fifteenth-ranked makushita.</i>

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:28.700
Your left arm wasn't at full strength.

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:32.000
That makes us 2-1. I'm leading.

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:35.650
Still, we'll be trading wins 
and losses from now on.

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:38.710
For now, I'm a makushita...

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:42.220
And you're a sandanme. Congratulations.

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.470
Glad to have you.

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:45.750
Yeah.

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:50.660
<i>After the Inter-High, 
Kuze-kun entered the pro league.</i>

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:54.980
<i>He joined in time for the 
September tournament.</i>

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:59.070
You're just a sandanme, 
but your size doesn't matter.

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:02.240
The door to your dream has opened.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:05.110
Welcome to the pro league, Hinomaru.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.780
Thank you.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:11.320
<i>But he only earned his place for one year.</i>

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:15.510
<i>In order to keep it, 
Ushio-kun had to drop out of high school.</i>

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:21.920
<i>That meant saying goodbye to the 
Odachi High School sumo club.</i>

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:27.470
Oh, Ushio-kun is a splendid student!

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:30.570
Our school will continue to cheer him on!

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:32.520
I'll do my best.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:37.250
I'll bet you're tired.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:40.650
It'll take time to get used 
to this type of thing.

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:44.410
It's even worse once 
you're in the pro league.

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:47.310
Especially for you, since your 
height makes you stand out.

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:49.240
Yes, sir. I understand.

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:52.270
Also that the attention can be fleeting.

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:56.670
It's been so dizzying up to today.

00:21:57.710 --> 00:21:59.770
The captain and Yuma are studying for exams.

00:21:59.770 --> 00:22:03.170
The others are busy with 
training and other things.

00:22:03.890 --> 00:22:08.430
It's a shame I wasn't able 
to say a proper goodbye.

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:11.120
But it's okay!

00:22:11.650 --> 00:22:15.560
I'll tell them by performing 
well in the pro league!

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:17.560
Okay, let's go!

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:22.190
What's that? A love letter?

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:26.050
The next best thing.

00:22:25.150 --> 00:22:27.030
<b>Challenge Letter</b>

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:29.780
Excuse me! Let me take care of something!

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:41.210
It's the captain's sumo ring 
that was destroyed!

00:22:41.810 --> 00:22:44.510
Ozeki explained how to make it.

00:22:44.850 --> 00:22:46.320
It was still a pain, though.

00:22:46.810 --> 00:22:51.220
It was a regret of mine for so long, 
but I'm glad it's here now.

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:55.600
Help me train before you go gallivanting off!

00:22:56.320 --> 00:22:57.580
That's not right.

00:22:58.390 --> 00:23:01.270
He's not helping us train. 
We're doing this for real.

00:23:01.270 --> 00:23:02.860
Damn straight!

00:23:03.050 --> 00:23:04.980
What's the point otherwise?

00:23:06.210 --> 00:23:07.940
It's our farewell present.

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:11.440
The Dachi High sumo club's 
serious style you helped create.

00:23:11.440 --> 00:23:13.240
You'd better be ready!

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:14.790
Guys...

00:23:16.150 --> 00:23:20.250
Farewell sumo, huh? You must be crazy,
as cold as it is out here.

00:23:22.340 --> 00:23:24.000
Who do you think you're talking to?!

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:26.290
I'm strong!

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:28.600
Get ready for this!
